# Moonrise Cleric: "Flying" and "Whenever this creature attacks, you gain 1 life." Bot1 attacks with the Cleric and an Ornithopter
# together: only the Cleric's own attack trigger gains life (CR 508.1m, 603.2), so Bot1 gains 1, not 2, and nothing is gained
# before the attack. Bot2's Grizzly Bears cannot block the Cleric (flying, CR 702.9b) while Bot2's Ornithopter, which also flies, can:
# the refusal sits beside the allowed block. Bot2's own life is only reduced by the unblocked damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Moonrise Cleric
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Moonrise Cleric.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Attack(Moonrise Cleric > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 21
! Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Moonrise Cleric)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Moonrise Cleric)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot2.Life = 20
